# Line endings, normalised in the repository, native in the working tree.
* text=auto

# The symbol art is a grid, and a carriage return is a column.
#
# core.autocrlf is on for this machine, so without this line a fresh Windows
# checkout hands src/assets/portrait.txt back with CRLF endings. Every row then
# measures one character wider than it draws, and the component sizes the type
# from the longest line, so the whole picture renders slightly too small and
# slightly off. AsciiArt.astro strips the carriage returns anyway, but a file
# whose bytes depend on who checked it out is the wrong thing to be defending
# against in a template.
*.txt -text
